<description><![CDATA[<div>阿富汗库纳尔省一所学校附近的存储采矿炸药的仓库11月28日发生爆炸，造成至少10名学生死亡，约110人受伤。初步调查显示，爆炸是由于疏忽导致，当局仍在调查事故详情。<br/>（<a href="https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/28/students-killed-injured-in-school-explosion-in-afghanistans-kunar-region" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">半岛电视台</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/T1lF_e9q7sqeza33BeSCcExUnTYVVe8GsxWXJzJXIY_HSgHYxZFPUsyEceAU9PqOFD_DsoMkUvu8YZXoVCCgwX5DYpSgD4mU2lNDvl7PxF6D_S75Io7aFwBmkZIGFbt0RAI32ub8XLq15vlhPcItKDKJiBMCQNDrvQksSD7ZnV8HQw5VWZtvTa7Dy-X58Er6We3j6pVK_S09xgEpMl78sXSU2wC4__bwLT2SotR1FmPde3RiiwNXuxL8ZicVM6jnCPeRkGUVs3mlen2CXwvAkBmBrWMaTKEuZ5jrPs3uiuQvY97Xm0SABvYxSLeMYP2sCMsBlQN0_q7A1hl6CGvHWA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
