<title>乌克兰已在4天内连续3次袭击克里米亚大桥。克里米亚大桥铁路段的列车通行暂停，当局预计交通能于19日16时左右恢复。普京表</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35794</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35794</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:33:05 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>乌克兰已在4天内连续3次袭击克里米亚大桥。克里米亚大桥铁路段的列车通行暂停，当局预计交通能于19日16时左右恢复。<br/>普京表示，克里米亚大桥是民用资产，他已禁止克里米亚大桥用于军事装备或弹药运输。普京誓言会作出回应并重建桥梁。<br/>（<a href="https://apnews.com/article/russia-ukraine-war-kerch-bridge-putin-crimea-7b4a86809dcd466bba97d374045a1a78" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/fF0db4ilO-inexfoLnme2eUNw42PqZOQEFiqjqrH6iYcKBG6B5po6MXjCBZPncTV7Q8DjDKKWGzZ1j8unx-T4WvrAbOr0okgVx3hXF0ybmTNZ1bTnvPWDBvZk9UiAcDAsPTSL1axbtwaTdAnjd7sTvPoWMDAdhydD8Qxy9RpClM-oX03AXy2kibkUPXKV4wWiNk505XOx3eN15P0CsLyxySWFLi4APe2Rl7Cq3ZRj_d01M9lPt8LcmYcfw3HKF_1mqGjvzDKRYOJ_4Tf5wZlWnfZh7_vnlKVLo9FGzSTzR41yjuiTbO7AdxQIJGpdDhc0Dfjv2dFhbyI-4UlkBV7yw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
